  "settingsWelcomeTitle": "Set up AI to start logging",
  "settingsWelcomeBody": "Pick a provider and paste its API key (it saves as you type), then tap Test This Provider.\nThen turn on Watch Camera Roll and new food photos log themselves.",
  "settingsSectionAi": "AI",
  "settingsAiFooterPaused": "Analyses are paused — Gemini's daily limit was reached (a free tier allows only a limited number of requests a day). New photos are kept and retried automatically. To resume now, turn on billing in Google AI Studio and run Test This Provider, or change the key or provider on the AI Provider page.",
