  "providerQuotaPausedUntil": "Analyses are paused until {time} — Gemini's daily limit was reached (a free tier allows only a limited number of requests a day). New photos are kept and retried automatically. To resume now, turn on billing in Google AI Studio and run Test This Provider, or change the key or provider.",
