  "settingsRowAiProvider": "AI Provider",
  "settingsSectionPhotos": "Photos",
  "settingsPhotosFooter": "The watcher logs new food photos automatically; the lookback window decides how far back catch-up scans reach. While Watch Camera Roll is on, new photos — and, when you turn it on, the photos from the last {days, plural, =1{day} other{{days} days}} — are sent to the AI service you chose.",
  "@settingsPhotosFooter": {
    "description": "Photos section footer. {days} is the current lookback window: turning the watcher on sweeps it right away, so photos taken before the user agreed are sent too.",
    "placeholders": {
