  "backupICloudFooterOff": "Nothing is being copied to iCloud Drive, so your meals would not come back after a reinstall, or on a new iPhone that does not get this iPhone's data from a backup or a transfer. Before either, export a file, then import it afterwards. API keys are never included, and the developer receives nothing.",
